{"about_the_game":"Aurum Kings is a competitive arena game where the goal is to become the richest in the land!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect Gold</h2>Gain gold while you hold the crown, or pick it up throughout the time spent in each level! The first player to reach the set amount of gold wins!!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cause Chaos</h2>Use your chosen ability to give you the edge in each match, blowing others into lava pits, or stunning them with a bear trap!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Environments</h2>Each map is different, with a new environmental mechanic!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast-Paced gameplay</h2>The enemy has victory in the sights, gloating about far ahead they are compared to everyone else when suddenly,<strong><i>BOOM!</i></strong> They get pushed into a corner by a bomb, trapped, you take the crown from them and dive away, making an epic comeback for the victory.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"","localized_name":"Play on Forest","name":"Play on Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848460/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"Play on Desert","name":"Play on Desert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848460/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"Play on River","name":"Play on River","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848460/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"Play on Castle","name":"Play on Castle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848460/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"Play on Lava","name":"Play on Lava","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848460/"},{"icon":"","localized_name":"Play on Spinning Walls","name":"Play on Spinning Walls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848460/"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/848460?t=1532641775","background_raw":"https